WEBVTT

00:00:07.187 --> 00:00:10.947
I don't have a choice, Buzz.
This is my only chance.

00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:12.627
To do what, Woody?

00:00:12.747 --> 00:00:16.067
Watch kids from behind glass
and never be loved again?

00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:17.627
Some life.

00:00:22.227 --> 00:00:24.867
TV WOODY: Is everybody okay?
TV JESSIE: Sheriff Woody!

00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:28.587
-I knew you'd make it!
-Now, remember, deputies,

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:31.387
the real treasures are
your friends and family.

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:34.947
Before I go, kids, I want to share
somethin' special with you,

00:00:35.027 --> 00:00:38.067
-for the times I'm not around.
-Good going, Woody!

00:00:38.187 --> 00:00:39.627
I thought they'd never leave.

00:00:39.707 --> 00:00:41.827
TV WOODY:
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:00:42.627 --> 00:00:45.067
♪ You've got a friend in me

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:47.827
-Woody?
-♪ You've got troubles

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:50.827
♪ Well, I've got 'em too

00:00:50.907 --> 00:00:54.867
♪ There isn't anything
I wouldn't do for you

00:00:54.947 --> 00:00:57.947
♪ We stick together
and see it through

00:00:58.027 --> 00:01:01.387
♪ 'Cause you've got a friend in me

00:01:03.187 --> 00:01:07.347
♪ Some other folks might be
a little bit smarter than I am

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:11.387
♪ Bigger and stronger too
Maybe

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:14.987
♪ But none of them will ever love you

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:19.787
♪ The way I do
It's me and you, boy

00:01:19.867 --> 00:01:22.427
♪ And as the years go by

00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:26.707
♪ Our friendship will never die

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:31.067
-(SIGHS) What am I doing?
-♪ You're gonna see it's our destiny ♪

00:01:31.827 --> 00:01:34.787
-Buzz! Wait! Wait!
-Woody, where are you going?

00:01:34.867 --> 00:01:38.067
You're right, Prospector.
I can't stop Andy from growing up.

00:01:38.147 --> 00:01:40.387
But I wouldn't miss it for the world.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:43.187
-No!
-Buzz!

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:44.307
-Yes?
-Yes?

00:01:44.387 --> 00:01:45.867
I'm coming with you!

00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:49.107
(GASPS) Wait, wait, wait.
I'll be back in just a second.

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:50.787
Way to go, cowboy!

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:54.787
-Hey, you guys... Come with me.
-What?

00:01:54.867 --> 00:01:57.227
Andy will play with all of us.
I know it!

00:01:57.307 --> 00:01:59.187
Woody, I don't know. I...

00:01:59.267 --> 00:02:02.507
Wouldn't you give anything
just to have one more day with Emily?

00:02:03.107 --> 00:02:07.307
Come on, Jessie. This is what
it's all about, to make a child happy.

00:02:07.387 --> 00:02:10.907
And you know it.
Bullseye, are you with me?

00:02:11.387 --> 00:02:13.427
(CHUCKLING) Okay, good boy.

00:02:13.507 --> 00:02:15.307
Prospector, how 'bout you?

00:02:16.827 --> 00:02:18.507
-(METALLIC THUD)
-(GASPS)

00:02:19.867 --> 00:02:22.227
-JESSIE: Prospector?
-You're outta your box!

00:02:23.627 --> 00:02:25.827
I tried reasoning with you, Woody,

00:02:25.907 --> 00:02:29.547
but you keep forcing me
to take extreme measures.

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:34.507
Wait a minute. You turned on the TV
last night, not Jessie.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:38.227
Look, we have an eternity
to spend together in the museum.

00:02:38.307 --> 00:02:41.307
Let's not start off
by pointing fingers, shall we?

00:02:41.387 --> 00:02:43.427
You really are Stinky Pete, aren't you?

00:02:43.507 --> 00:02:44.787
Prospector, this isn't fair.

00:02:45.227 --> 00:02:48.267
"Fair"? I'll tell you what's not fair.

00:02:48.347 --> 00:02:53.947
Spending a lifetime on a dime-store
shelf watching every other toy be sold.

00:02:54.227 --> 00:02:56.147
Well, finally my waiting has paid off,

00:02:56.227 --> 00:03:00.747
and no hand-me-down cowboy doll
is gonna mess it up for me now!

00:03:03.427 --> 00:03:05.707
Buzz. Help, Buzz! Guys!

00:03:05.787 --> 00:03:09.907
It's too late, Woody. That silly
Buzz Lightweight can't help you.

00:03:09.987 --> 00:03:11.867
His name is Buzz Lightyear.

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:15.867
Whatever. I've always hated
those upstart space toys.

00:03:16.587 --> 00:03:18.947
(GRUNTING) It's stuck! What do we do?

00:03:19.027 --> 00:03:21.307
-Should I use my head?
-(GRUNTS, GASPS)

00:03:21.387 --> 00:03:23.707
-(RUMBLING)
-It's Al!

00:03:23.787 --> 00:03:24.787
(GASPS)

00:03:26.387 --> 00:03:28.507
Look at the time. I'm gonna be late!

00:03:28.587 --> 00:03:30.827
Figures. I can't miss this flight!
I've gotta pack.

00:03:30.947 --> 00:03:33.827
All right. Let's see.
Wallet, keys, tickets,

00:03:33.907 --> 00:03:36.067
passport, beef jerky,
very expensive over there.

00:03:36.147 --> 00:03:38.227
Shower! (SNIFFS)
Oh, I can skip the shower.

00:03:38.307 --> 00:03:42.227
I just gotta get outta here now!
(MUTTERS INDISTINCTLY)

00:03:43.227 --> 00:03:44.747
Quick! To the elevator!

00:03:49.107 --> 00:03:50.347
(BUZZING)

00:03:51.187 --> 00:03:52.587
Hurry. I can hear it coming.

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:55.467
(GASPS)

00:03:57.587 --> 00:04:00.627
So, we meet again, Buzz Lightyear,

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:02.147
for the last time.

00:04:02.227 --> 00:04:06.227
Aah! It's Zurg! Watch out!
He's got an ion blaster!

00:04:10.747 --> 00:04:11.747
(SCREAMS)

00:04:16.787 --> 00:04:17.827
(BELL DINGS)

00:04:20.347 --> 00:04:21.907
Quick! Get on!

00:04:22.787 --> 00:04:25.107
-(GASPS)
-(WHIMPERS)

00:04:26.027 --> 00:04:27.827
The emergency hatch! Come on!

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:31.027
(WHIMPERS, YELLS)

00:04:38.667 --> 00:04:39.667
(GROANS)

00:04:42.947 --> 00:04:43.947
Huh?

00:04:47.667 --> 00:04:52.067
-Come on! Hurry!
-(WHIMPERS) But Buzz is in peril!

00:04:52.147 --> 00:04:54.867
VOICE BOX: (REPEATING)
Buzz, Buzz, Buzz...

00:04:57.107 --> 00:04:58.187
(MUTTERING)

00:05:05.227 --> 00:05:08.747
Surrender, Buzz Lightyear. I have won.

00:05:08.987 --> 00:05:11.587
I'll never give in.
You killed my father!

00:05:12.027 --> 00:05:15.747
No, Buzz. I AM your father.

00:05:15.987 --> 00:05:19.707
No!

00:05:20.627 --> 00:05:23.587
(SIGHS IMPATIENTLY)
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:05:26.547 --> 00:05:30.467
(WHIMPERS) Buzz, you could have
defeated Zurg all along!

00:05:30.547 --> 00:05:33.627
You just need to believe in yourself!
(GASPS)

00:05:33.707 --> 00:05:36.867
-Prepare to die!
-(WHIMPERS) I can't look!

00:05:37.907 --> 00:05:41.187
Whoa! (YELLING)

00:05:44.787 --> 00:05:48.547
I did it. I finally defeated Zurg!

00:05:49.347 --> 00:05:50.667
Father.

00:05:56.627 --> 00:05:57.947
(GASPS, GRUNTS)

00:05:58.027 --> 00:06:00.067
-(BELL DINGS)
-Ah, finally!

00:06:08.227 --> 00:06:09.467
(TOYS GRUNT)

